# WebUI Angular templates

When editing `Web/WebUI/**/*.html`, follow the same load order as TypeScript frontend coding:

1. [`Web/WebUI/convention.md`](../../Web/WebUI/convention.md)
2. [`Web/WebUI/.agents/RULES/coding/coding-principles.md`](../../Web/WebUI/.agents/RULES/coding/coding-principles.md)
3. [`webui-coding`](../../.agents/skills/webui-coding/SKILL.md)

For `iap/**` templates (visualizer / explore), also load [`iap-lap-coding`](../../.agents/skills/iap-lap-coding/SKILL.md) and when changing plugins [`iap-plugin-architecture-frontend`](../../.agents/skills/iap-plugin-architecture-frontend/SKILL.md).
